      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bingham%2C_Maine",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Old Canada Road, which ran through Bingham, linked Lower Canada and Maine from 1820 to 1860.",
